---
description: Repository-wide coding guidelines for this monorepo
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md as the primary policy.

Additional enforcement:
- Respect namespace conventions and keep @repo/* imports.
- Prefer package exports and workspace imports instead of fragile relative deep imports.
- Keep changes aligned with Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind 4, Turbo 2, Biome 2, TypeScript 6.
- Do not reintroduce deprecated compiler options or outdated framework APIs.
- Validate with pnpm run format, pnpm run lint, pnpm run check, and pnpm run build from repository root.
